@startuml
title SBOM and VEX are related but different artifacts

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 15
}

rectangle "Product release" as PRODUCT
rectangle "SBOM" as SBOM
database "Vulnerability intelligence\n(CVE, advisories)" as VULN
rectangle "Analysis process" as ANALYSIS
rectangle "VEX statement" as VEX
actor "Customer / Security team" as USER

PRODUCT --> SBOM : composition data
SBOM --> ANALYSIS : what components exist
VULN --> ANALYSIS : what issues are known
ANALYSIS --> VEX : applicability decision
SBOM --> USER : product contents
VEX --> USER : affected / not affected /\nfixed / mitigated

note right of SBOM
Answers:
what is inside?
end note

note right of VEX
Answers:
does the vulnerability
actually affect us?
end note

@enduml
